- Hair cycle (anagen, catagen, telogen); patterns of hair loss (androgenetic, stress-related shedding, patchy loss, traction)
- Scalp conditions such as dandruff and seborrhoeic dermatitis', 3) on conflict (id) do nothing;
- Nutrition, sleep, stress and hair; why diagnosis is the doctor''s job
- Practice: skin type and Fitzpatrick identification on models; slide quiz; scalp photos', 4) on conflict (id) do nothing;
