- Call only people who enquired or consented; honour do-not-disturb requests and the telecom commercial-communication rules (DND registry, registered sender and templates) as confirmed by the legal advisor', 1) on conflict (id) do nothing;
- Tell patients when calls are recorded; never share patient details with anyone else
